{
  "title": "Women Initiative",
  "language": "EN",
  "slug": "/women",
  "layout": "../layouts/PageLayout.astro",
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "hero",
      "title": "Hot Girls Build Startups",
      "heroTagline": "An Initiative by PionierGarage",
      "image": "/src/assets/women_hero_desktop-1.png",
      "mobileImage": "/src/assets/women_hero_mobile-1.png",
      "style": {
        "alignment": "center",
        "size": "full"
      },
      "titleStyle": {
        "size": "large",
        "color": "accent-pink",
        "alignment": "center"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "spacer",
      "size": "80px",
      "style": {
        "alignment": "left",
        "size": "full"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "columns",
      "gap": "small",
      "verticalAlign": "center",
      "columns": [
        {
          "width": "1/3",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "rich-text",
              "content": "What we do",
              "style": {
                "alignment": "left",
                "size": "full",
                "className": "font-accent text-accent-pink m-0 p-0"
              }
            },
            {
              "type": "rich-text",
              "content": "# We create the room where the future takes shape.",
              "style": {
                "alignment": "left",
                "size": "full",
                "className": "m-0 p-0 [&_h1]:mt-0"
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "width": "2/3",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "rich-text",
              "content": "Karlsruhe's community for women who move things — and the allies who back them. \n\nHere you'll find peers, sharpen your ideas, and meet people who share knowledge and open doors. No gatekeeping. No empty empowerment phrases. Just real connections, new perspectives, and space to try things out.\nCome with an idea. Leave with tailwind.",
              "style": {
                "alignment": "left",
                "size": "full",
                "className": "[&_p]:text-primary-muted [&_p]:text-lg [&_p]:leading-relaxed"
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "style": {
        "alignment": "left",
        "size": "full"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "spacer",
      "size": "50px",
      "style": {
        "alignment": "left",
        "size": "full"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "custom-block",
      "component": "StatsOverview",
      "props": {
        "stats": [
          { "value": 10, "caption": "Active Women", "suffix": "%" },
          { "value": 30, "caption": "Members", "suffix": "" },
          { "value": 0, "caption": "Sponsors", "suffix": "" }
        ]
      },
      "style": {
        "alignment": "center",
        "size": "full"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "spacer",
      "size": "50px",
      "style": {
        "alignment": "left",
        "size": "full"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "columns",
      "gap": "small",
      "verticalAlign": "center",
      "columns": [
        {
          "width": "1/3",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "rich-text",
              "content": "Who this is for",
              "style": {
                "alignment": "left",
                "size": "full",
                "className": "font-accent text-accent-pink m-0 p-0"
              }
            },
            {
              "type": "rich-text",
              "content": "# No experience needed. Just curiosity.",
              "style": {
                "alignment": "left",
                "size": "full",
                "className": "m-0 p-0 [&_h1]:mt-0"
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "width": "2/3",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "rich-text",
              "content": "You don't need a company, a co-founder, or a five-year plan. You need curiosity — and the willingness to spend an evening around people who are figuring it out too. Come to get inspired, co-work in our office, test half-baked ideas, or just listen. This is a safe space: honest questions, no judgment, no bro-culture. If you've ever thought 'maybe I could build something' — this is where you start.",
              "style": {
                "alignment": "left",
                "size": "full",
                "className": "[&_p]:text-primary-muted [&_p]:text-lg [&_p]:leading-relaxed"
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "style": {
        "alignment": "left",
        "size": "full"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "spacer",
      "size": "80px",
      "style": {
        "alignment": "left",
        "size": "full"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "custom-block",
      "component": "TeamGallery",
      "props": {
        "source": "women-team",
        "showContact": false
      },
      "style": {
        "alignment": "center",
        "size": "full"
      }
    }
  ]
}